# TypeScript SDK build

- The npm package lives in `typescript-sdk/`. The repo root has no `package.json`.
  Always `cd` there (or set that working directory) before `npm` commands.
- `protoc` is a **local** `devDependency`. `npm run regenerate` / `npm run build`
  use `node_modules/.bin/protoc`. Never `npx protoc` — that hits `~/.npm/_npx`
  outside the workspace and hangs in the agent sandbox.
- If a shell command hangs with no output after `npx` or `npm run regenerate`,
  kill it. Rerun `npm run build` with `required_permissions: ["all"]` only if
  the local binary is missing; first try a normal `npm run build` after
  `npm install`.
- Tests use Vitest (`npm test` → `vitest run`). Do not use `node --test`. Keep
  tests sequential (`fileParallelism: false`, `singleFork: true`) so integration
  tests do not share UDP ports.
